  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>🌡️ Pixel Temp</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Convert Celsius ↔ Fahrenheit</p>\n\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n      <input id=\"temperature\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n      <select id=\"direction\">\n        <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n        <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n\n    <button id=\"convert\" type=\"button\">Convert</button>\n\n    <div class=\"result-box\">\n      <span class=\"result-label\">Result</span>\n      <output id=\"result\">--</output>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"formulas\">\n      <p><strong>C → F:</strong> x × 9/5 + 32</p>\n      <p><strong>F → C:</strong> (x − 32) × 5/9</p>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": "Main HTML page with labeled input, select, button, and output."
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --muted: #8a8fa3;\n  --border: #0f3460;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--border);\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.subtitle {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.field {\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n\ninput, select {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  color: var(--text);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  outline: none;\n}\n\ninput:focus, select:focus {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent);\n}\n\ninput:hover, select:hover {\n  border-color: var(--muted);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  color: var(--bg);\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, background 0.15s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #ff5e7e;\n  border-color: #ff5e7e;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.result-box {\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  padding: 14px;\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.result-label {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n#result {\n  font-size: 1.8rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n.formulas {\n  border-top: 2px dashed var(--border);\n  padding-top: 14px;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n.formulas strong {\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--border);\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n  }\n}\n",
      "description": "Pixel-style CSS with responsive layout and focus states."
    },
    {
      "path": "app.js",
      "content": "const tempInput = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst direction = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst convertBtn = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst resultEl = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const raw = tempInput.value.trim();\n  if (raw === '') {\n    resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  const num = Number(raw);\n  if (!isFinite(num)) {\n    resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  let out;\n  if (direction.value === 'c-to-f') {\n    out = num * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else {\n    out = (num - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n  resultEl.textContent = out.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nconvertBtn.addEventListener('click', convert);\n\ntempInput.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n    convert();\n  }\n});\n",
      "description": "Conversion logic with validation and event listeners."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nOffline pixel-style temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript.\n\n## Features\n- Convert Celsius ↔ Fahrenheit\n- Pixel-art inspired UI with cohesive dark palette\n- Keyboard accessible (Tab + Enter)\n- Responsive down to 360px\n\n## Formulas\n- **C → F:** `x * 9/5 + 32`\n- **F → C:** `(x - 32) * 5/9`\n\n## Usage\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a temperature value.\n3. Choose conversion direction.\n4. Click **Convert** or press **Enter** in the input.\n5. Result appears with exactly two decimals (no units).\n\nInvalid, empty or non-finite input shows `Error`.\n\n## Constraints\n- No packages, imports, network requests, external assets, iframes or server code.\n- No storage APIs.\n- Total source under 200 lines.\n",
